<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46234" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζημί-ωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζημιόω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>penalty, fine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Prom.</u>
				13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				5174.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς
			ἀταξίας</span> for their disorder, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				3.1.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώματα ἔστω ἀστυνόμοις</span>
			let them have <i>the right of imposing penalties</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				764c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>loss</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῆμμα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				419.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; <i>injury, damage</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ. προστρίβεσθαί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					52.33
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
